# Assessment artifact storage — see documents/future/v4/2026-07-05-phases-5-6-*
# The container mount is /usr/src/assessments (docker-managed volume). If anyone
# ever changes the mount to a host bind that lands inside this repo, keep those
# files out of git — nothing under an assessments/ directory should ever bleed
# into the repository.
assessments/
usr/src/assessments/
# Some scan-pipeline code writes assessment work into web/assessment_<uuid>_<hash>/
# — likely a bug where a relative cwd got used instead of /usr/src/scan_results
# or /usr/src/assessments. Ignore the artifacts regardless.
web/assessment_*/

