# Key material must never be committed. A stray privkey.pem turned up untracked
# in a deploy checkout with no rule covering it, one `git add -A` from landing
# in history. No .pem/.key/.crt is tracked, so these patterns are safe.
*.pem
*.key
*.crt

# Companion repositories cloned next to this one (the compose build context for
# the MCP sidecar is <repo>/r3ngine-mcp). They are separate git checkouts.
